{"seq":3,"slug":"concurrent-mode","title":"并发模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/core-concepts/concurrent-mode","wordCount":920,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"并发模式\">并发模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>并发模式允许 React 同时准备多个版本的 UI：高优先级的用户交互立即响应，低优先级渲染在后台进行并随时可被中断。它由时间切片、优先级 Lanes 与 Suspense 三部分共同支撑。本章从同步渲染的阻塞问题出发，讲解 Time Slicing 的时间预算、<code>startTransition</code> 与 <code>useDeferredValue</code> 这两类并发 API 的差异，以及 Suspense 在并发模式下获得的数据获取与选择性水合能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从同步到并发\">从同步到并发</h2><p>传统 React 渲染是同步的——一次 <code>setState</code> 触发一次完整渲染，中间无法中断。当渲染耗时较长时，用户输入会被阻塞。<strong>并发模式（Concurrent Mode）</strong> 允许 React 同时准备多个版本的 UI，在保证高优先级交互响应的同时，在后台完成低优先级渲染。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 同步模式&#10;        S1[用户输入] --&gt; S2[开始渲染]&#10;        S2 --&gt; S3[渲染完成]&#10;        S3 --&gt; S4[响应输入]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 并发模式&#10;        C1[用户输入] --&gt; C2[高优先级渲染]&#10;        C1 --&gt; C3[低优先级渲染暂停]&#10;        C2 --&gt; C4[立即响应]&#10;        C4 --&gt; C5[恢复低优先级渲染]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 同步模式\n        S1[用户输入] --&gt; S2[开始渲染]\n        S2 --&gt; S3[渲染完成]\n        S3 --&gt; S4[响应输入]\n    end\n    subgraph 并发模式\n        C1[用户输入] --&gt; C2[高优先级渲染]\n        C1 --&gt; C3[低优先级渲染暂停]\n        C2 --&gt; C4[立即响应]\n        C4 --&gt; C5[恢复低优先级渲染]\n    end</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> React 18 默认启用并发特性，但只有使用 <code>createRoot</code> 才能激活。<code>ReactDOM.render</code> 仍然以同步模式运行。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"time-slicing-时间切片\">Time Slicing 时间切片</h2><p>时间切片是并发模式的底层实现。React 将渲染工作拆分为多个小任务，每完成一个任务就检查是否需要让出主线程。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function workLoopConcurrent(): void {&#10;  while (workInProgress !== null &amp;&amp; !shouldYield()) {&#10;    performUnitOfWork(workInProgress);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;function shouldYield(): boolean {&#10;  const currentTime = getCurrentTime();&#10;  return currentTime &gt;= deadline;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> workLoopConcurrent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (workInProgress </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">shouldYield</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    performUnitOfWork</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(workInProgress);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> shouldYield</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> currentTime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getCurrentTime</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currentTime </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deadline;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>时间切片确保每一帧中 React 只占用有限时间（通常 5ms），剩余时间留给浏览器处理动画、布局和绘制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>时间预算</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户输入处理</td>\n<td>~2ms</td>\n<td>事件回调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>React 渲染</td>\n<td>~5ms</td>\n<td>一个时间切片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布局与绘制</td>\n<td>~5ms</td>\n<td>浏览器排版和渲染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空闲</td>\n<td>剩余时间</td>\n<td>requestIdleCallback</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    F[一帧 16.6ms] --&gt; I[输入事件]&#10;    I --&gt; R[React 时间切片]&#10;    R --&gt; L[Layout / Paint]&#10;    L --&gt; ID[Idle]&#10;    ID --&gt; F2[下一帧]\">flowchart LR\n    F[一帧 16.6ms] --&gt; I[输入事件]\n    I --&gt; R[React 时间切片]\n    R --&gt; L[Layout / Paint]\n    L --&gt; ID[Idle]\n    ID --&gt; F2[下一帧]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"transitions\">Transitions</h2><p><code>startTransition</code> 是 React 18 提供的并发特性 API，用于标记某些状态更新为<strong>过渡更新</strong>，告诉 React 这些更新可以被中断。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { useState, useTransition } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;&#10;function SearchPage() {&#10;  const [query, setQuery] = useState(&#39;&#39;);&#10;  const [results, setResults] = useState&lt;string[]&gt;([]);&#10;  const [isPending, startTransition] = useTransition();&#10;&#10;  function handleChange(e: React.ChangeEvent&lt;HTMLInputElement&gt;) {&#10;    const value = e.target.value;&#10;    setQuery(value);&#10;&#10;    startTransition(() =&gt; {&#10;      const filtered = heavyFilter(value);&#10;      setResults(filtered);&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;input value={query} onChange={handleChange} /&gt;&#10;      {isPending &amp;&amp; &lt;span&gt;加载中...&lt;/span&gt;}&#10;      &lt;ResultList results={results} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { useState, useTransition } from 'react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function SearchPage() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [query, setQuery] = useState('');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [results, setResults] = useState&#x3C;string[]>([]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [isPending, startTransition] = useTransition();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  function handleChange(e: React.ChangeEvent&#x3C;HTMLInputElement>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const value = e.target.value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setQuery(value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    startTransition(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const filtered = heavyFilter(value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      setResults(filtered);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;input value={query} onChange={handleChange} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {isPending &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;span>加载中...&#x3C;/span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;ResultList results={results} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>startTransition</code> 内部的更新被标记为 TransitionLane，优先级低于用户输入（SyncLane / InputContinuousLane），因此输入框能立即响应，搜索结果在后台计算。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>API</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>是否可中断</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>setState</code></td>\n<td>Default</td>\n<td>否（同步批处理）</td>\n<td>普通 UI 更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>startTransition</code></td>\n<td>Transition</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>非紧急更新，如搜索结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>flushSync</code></td>\n<td>Sync</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>需要立即同步更新的特殊场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"usedeferredvalue\">useDeferredValue</h2><p><code>useDeferredValue</code> 是另一种使用并发特性的方式。它返回一个值的延迟版本——当有更高优先级的更新时，这个值会暂时保持旧值，等高优先级更新完成后再更新。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { useState, useDeferredValue, memo } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;&#10;function App() {&#10;  const [text, setText] = useState(&#39;&#39;);&#10;  const deferredText = useDeferredValue(text);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;input value={text} onChange={(e) =&gt; setText(e.target.value)} placeholder=&quot;输入搜索内容&quot; /&gt;&#10;      &lt;HeavyList text={deferredText} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;const HeavyList = memo(function HeavyList({ text }: { text: string }) {&#10;  const items = Array.from({ length: 10000 }, (_, i) =&gt; &lt;div key={i}&gt;{text ? `${text} - ${i}` : `Item ${i}`}&lt;/div&gt;);&#10;  return &lt;div&gt;{items}&lt;/div&gt;;&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { useState, useDeferredValue, memo } from 'react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [text, setText] = useState('');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const deferredText = useDeferredValue(text);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;input value={text} onChange={(e) => setText(e.target.value)} placeholder=\"输入搜索内容\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;HeavyList text={deferredText} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const HeavyList = memo(function HeavyList({ text }: { text: string }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const items = Array.from({ length: 10000 }, (_, i) => &#x3C;div key={i}>{text ? `${text} - ${i}` : `Item ${i}`}&#x3C;/div>);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;div>{items}&#x3C;/div>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[用户输入 abc] --&gt; B[&quot;text = &#39;abc&#39;(立即更新)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;deferredText = &#39;ab&#39;(延迟保持旧值)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[输入框立即响应]&#10;    C --&gt; E[HeavyList 使用旧值渲染]&#10;    E --&gt; F[空闲时更新 deferredText = abc]&#10;    F --&gt; G[HeavyList 使用新值重新渲染]\">flowchart TD\n    A[用户输入 abc] --&gt; B[\"text = 'abc'(立即更新)\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"deferredText = 'ab'(延迟保持旧值)\"]\n    B --&gt; D[输入框立即响应]\n    C --&gt; E[HeavyList 使用旧值渲染]\n    E --&gt; F[空闲时更新 deferredText = abc]\n    F --&gt; G[HeavyList 使用新值重新渲染]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>useDeferredValue</code> 和 <code>useTransition</code> 都是并发特性，区别在于：<code>useTransition</code> 包裹的是<strong>触发更新的代码</strong>，<code>useDeferredValue</code> 包裹的是<strong>被影响的值</strong>。当你无法控制状态更新的来源时（如来自 props），使用 <code>useDeferredValue</code> 更合适。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"suspense-boundaries\">Suspense Boundaries</h2><p><code>Suspense</code> 组件定义了 UI 的加载边界。当其子树中有组件尚未准备好（数据未加载、代码未下载），React 会显示 <code>fallback</code> 内容。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { Suspense, lazy } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;&#10;const Dashboard = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./Dashboard&#39;));&#10;const Analytics = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./Analytics&#39;));&#10;&#10;function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;Skeleton type=&quot;dashboard&quot; /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;Dashboard /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;Skeleton type=&quot;analytics&quot; /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;Analytics /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { Suspense, lazy } from 'react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const Dashboard = lazy(() => import('./Dashboard'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const Analytics = lazy(() => import('./Analytics'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;Skeleton type=\"dashboard\" />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Dashboard /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;Skeleton type=\"analytics\" />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Analytics /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在并发模式下，Suspense 具备更强大的能力：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>同步模式</th>\n<th>并发模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>代码分割</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据获取</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选择性水合</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌套 Suspense</td>\n<td>基础支持</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与 Transition 配合</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"suspense-与-transition-的配合\">Suspense 与 Transition 的配合</h3><p>当 <code>startTransition</code> 触发的更新导致 Suspense 挂起时，React 不会立即显示 fallback，而是继续展示当前 UI 直到新内容准备好：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function TabContainer() {&#10;  const [tab, setTab] = useState&lt;&#39;home&#39; | &#39;posts&#39; | &#39;about&#39;&gt;(&#39;home&#39;);&#10;  const [isPending, startTransition] = useTransition();&#10;&#10;  function selectTab(nextTab: &#39;home&#39; | &#39;posts&#39; | &#39;about&#39;) {&#10;    startTransition(() =&gt; {&#10;      setTab(nextTab);&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;nav style={{ opacity: isPending ? 0.7 : 1 }}&gt;&#10;        &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; selectTab(&#39;home&#39;)}&gt;首页&lt;/button&gt;&#10;        &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; selectTab(&#39;posts&#39;)}&gt;文章&lt;/button&gt;&#10;        &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; selectTab(&#39;about&#39;)}&gt;关于&lt;/button&gt;&#10;      &lt;/nav&gt;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;Loading /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        {tab === &#39;home&#39; &amp;&amp; &lt;Home /&gt;}&#10;        {tab === &#39;posts&#39; &amp;&amp; &lt;Posts /&gt;}&#10;        {tab === &#39;about&#39; &amp;&amp; &lt;About /&gt;}&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function TabContainer() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [tab, setTab] = useState&#x3C;'home' | 'posts' | 'about'>('home');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [isPending, startTransition] = useTransition();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  function selectTab(nextTab: 'home' | 'posts' | 'about') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    startTransition(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      setTab(nextTab);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;nav style={{ opacity: isPending ? 0.7 : 1 }}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;button onClick={() => selectTab('home')}>首页&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;button onClick={() => selectTab('posts')}>文章&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;button onClick={() => selectTab('about')}>关于&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/nav></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;Loading />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {tab === 'home' &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;Home />}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {tab === 'posts' &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;Posts />}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {tab === 'about' &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;About />}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>并发模式</strong> 允许 React 中断低优先级渲染以响应高优先级用户交互</li>\n<li><strong>时间切片</strong> 将渲染拆分为 5ms 左右的小任务，保证每帧都有时间进行浏览器绘制</li>\n<li><code>startTransition</code> 将非紧急更新标记为过渡优先级，避免阻塞用户输入</li>\n<li><code>useDeferredValue</code> 延迟值的更新，适用于无法控制更新源的场景</li>\n<li><strong>Suspense</strong> 在并发模式下支持数据获取、选择性水合等高级能力，与 Transition 配合可以避免不必要的 loading 状态闪烁</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"并发模式","id":"并发模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从同步到并发","id":"从同步到并发"},{"level":2,"text":"Time Slicing 时间切片","id":"time-slicing-时间切片"},{"level":2,"text":"Transitions","id":"transitions"},{"level":2,"text":"useDeferredValue","id":"usedeferredvalue"},{"level":2,"text":"Suspense Boundaries","id":"suspense-boundaries"},{"level":3,"text":"Suspense 与 Transition 的配合","id":"suspense-与-transition-的配合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"协调算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/core-concepts/reconciliation"},"next":{"title":"调度器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/core-concepts/scheduler"}}